<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timateo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda uamucivali ua Paulu kuli Timateo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timateo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda uamucivali ua Paulu kuli</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMATEO</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Livulu lia mucivali lia Timateo liapua mukanda uamucivali uakuhuma kuli kanganda Paulu uje uasonekelele ndongisi uendi Timateo. Mukanda ua Timateo uamucivali vausonekele kuyehi nakuhua ca muono ua Paulu. Vamuhakele mu kamenga mu Loma ha ntsimbu eyi (2 Tim 1:16) Paulu uakele na vusamba vuakukola na Timateo kaha vintsimbu viavingi uakele nakumutumbula nguendi munendi Fil 2:22; 1 Tim 1:2; 1:18.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ou ukeuo umo ua mikanda iuana yakuhuma kuli Paulu ije yasonekelelele ku muntu lika keti ku cikungulukilo. Ikuavo itatu ku mikanda eyi ikeyo ya Timateo uakulivanga, na Tito na Filimoni. Ha ntsimbu ije mukanda ua Timateo uamucivali vakele naku usoneka, vaka Kilistu vakele nakuvapakesa mu nganda ya Loma. Eci cikeco canehele linga Paulu vamuhake mu kamenga kaha uakele nakushika Timateo linga atualeleleho nalukakateya mukukaluua. Ngue kuya mu Timateo uakulivanga, Paulu ahana Timateo vinangulo viavingi ha valongisi vamakuli (1 Tim 1:16-18) Kaha naua alekesa Timateo nguendi kukakala vintsimbu via kukaluua kulutue (3:1)</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulu aputuka nakuhinduisa Timateo 1:1-2, kaha ambahoni amukolese 1:3-18</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ambahoni alekesa Timateo linga atualeleleho nalukakateya 2:1-13</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Cakuhatako amuhana vinangulo vimo vije muasa kuyoyelamo 2:14-26</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ambahoni amunangula ha vije vikalingiua kulutue na ngila yacili muje vati akasa kuvitambula 3:1; 4:8</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Paulu amanusula na mezi endi lika kuli Timateo 4:9-24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Yange Paulu, kanganda ua Kilistu Yesu ku cizango ca Njambi kuya ku cikulaheso ca muono uje uli muli Kilistu Yesu,<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Njikusonekela yove Timateo, munange injazanga:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Kavumbi, cikeketima na ciyulo vije vihuminina kuli Njambi Tate na Kilistu Yesu Muene uetu vikale kuli yove.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsantsela na kulikolesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Njitsantsela Njambi uje injikapangela na mana akutungukua, ngue muje muvalingile vakukuluila vange, omo njikamivuluka vintsimbu vioshe mu malombelo ange. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ngue muje njikavuluka masozi ove, njikatondo cikuma vutsiki na mutania kukumona, linga njakushule nanzolela. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Njilina kuvuluka lutsilielo luove lua vusunga, lutsilielo luje luakele ha kulivanga muli kuku yove uampuevo Loisi na vanoko Yunisi nahano vene, cilivene nguange nove uli naluo. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Ha cuma eci njikuanukisa ngeci uvuezelele kupangesa vuana vua Njambi vuje vuli muli yove kuhitila muje munjakusalekele mavoko ange. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Muomu Njambi katuhanene Cimbembesi ua liova vuno honi Cimbembesi ua nzili na cizango na kulihilula yetu vavenia.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Keti uvue shuamua ya kuhana vukaleho vua Muene uetu, cipue kunjivuila shuamua yange cinzinda muomu ya mulonga ua Kilistu, vuno honi lipangele nange mukuyandela Muzimbu Uacili mu nzili ya Njambi. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Ikeye uatuovuele nakutusana nakusana ca kulela, keti ngue kuya ku vipangi vietu vuno honi ku vutumbe vuendi na kavumbi vije viatuhanene muli Kilistu Yesu tele kanda mavu va atange, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />vuno honi vanacisholola kuhitila mukusholoka ca Muyoyesi uetu Kilistu Yesu, uje nanongesa kutsa nakuneha muono na kuhona kutsa ku ceke kuhitila mu Muzimbu Uacili. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Muomu ya Muzimbu Uacili ou, vanjihanguile kupua muka kuambulula na kanganda na mulongisi, <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />nankuma njilinakuyanda ngue muje munjili nakuyandelamo. Vuno honi kunjesi na shuamua, muomu njazivuka uje njinatsiliela, kaha njazivuka cilivene asa kuniunga muacili vije vinjinakundika kuli ikeye noho ha Litangua lije. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Kavangeya cimueso ca mezi a vusunga aje unevu kuli yange mu lutsilielo na cizango vije vili muli Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Niunga muacili vusunga vuje vuvanakundika kuli yove na Cimbembesi Uakulela uje uakala muli yetu.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Uazivuka nguove voshe vaje vali mu Asiya vananjitengulukila, kupandakana kumo na Fingeliase na Helemengenese. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Muene ahane cikeketima ku ntanga ya Onesifolase, muomu vintsimbu viavingi ikeye nakala nakunjilisa, kakele na shuamua cipue vene uazivukile ngeci yange njili mu kamenga, <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />vuno honi omo uahetele mu Loma, uanjitondele cikuma nakunjiuana. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Muene amutavese linga auane cikeketima cije cikahumu kuli Muene ha Litangua lije! Nove naua uazivuka muacili vipangi vije viakuasele mu Efeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Lisualale uakuononoka ua Kilistu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Ambahoni yove munange, kolesa mu kavumbi kaje kali muli Kilistu Yesu, <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />na vije viunovu kuli yange ha mesho a vakaleho vavengi vaje vakundama ku vantu vakulongua vaje vasa kulongesa naua vakuavo. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Lipangele mu tuyando ngue lisualale uakuononoka ua Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Naumo uahi lisualale asa kulinga nevi na vije mu vipangi viendi via vusualale, muomu viyongola viendi vinapu kutonda kuvuahelesa uje ntuama yendi. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Muka kushatuka kuvasa kumuzika cilongo kuvanga ashatuke muailamo mashiko. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Ndimi uakupanga cikuma ikeye napande kukala na mutambela uakulivanga ua vimbuto. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Singaniekaho hali evi njihandeka, muomu Muene akakuhana kuvuisisa muli vioshe.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Vuluka Yesu Kilistu, vamusanguile ku vatsi, uapuile mutekuluila ua Ndaviti, ngue muvana viambulula mu Muzimbu Uacili uange, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />uje unjilinakuyandela nakukala mu malienge ngue nji muhuza. Vuno honi lizi lia Njambi likelio kuliesi mu malienge. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Nankuma njilina kutualelelaho nalukakateya mu viuma vioshe ha mulonga ua vaje vavanahangula, linga navakevo vakauane kuovoka muli Kilistu Yesu na vumpau vua yaye. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Eci kuhandeka capua ca vusunga cije cihandeka nguaco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Nga tunatsi nendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">aha naua tukayoya nendi,<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Nga tutualelelaho na lukakateya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">kaha naua tukayula nendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">nga tumuviana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">nendi naua akatuviana.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Nga yetu kutuakonkamene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">ikeye hanga uapua uakukonkama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">muomu kasa kuliviana ikeye vavenia.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muka vipangi uje ivanatambula kuli Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Vavulukise evi, kaha vanangule ku mesho a Muene linga keti vakale na vimpata ha mezi, eci kucesi naseho, vuno honi cipihisa vaje vaka kuvuilila. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Linga mu uaselamo kulihana yove vavenia kuli Njambi ngue uje ivanatambula, ngue muka kupanga uje kasa kukala na shuamua, uje akuata muacili lizi lia vusunga. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Litenge ku vimpata via kasauntu na vimpande via vupi vije vituala lika vantu kulahako na Njambi. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Kaha vimpande viavo vinapu ngue mbandu yamukongo. Vamo hakati kavo vapuile Haimenease na Filetase, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />vakevo vaje vanaseza vusunga muomu vahandeka nguavo kusanguka cinahiti laja. Valinakupihisa lutsilielo lua vakuavo. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Vuno honi luvula lua Njambi hanga luemana ngoo, na kasateso aka nguavo, “Muene azivuka vaje vendi,” kaha naua nguavo, “Eceleni uoshe uje atumbula lizina lia Muene ahume ku viuma via mazilo.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Mu njivo yakama kumuakele lika vitenga via ngolinde cipue via siliva vuno honi na via kupanga ha miti na via vuma, vimo via ha cipale navikuavo viakupangesa lika ntsimbu yoshe. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Nga umo alilelesa ikeye vavenia ku vitenga viakupangesa ntsimbu yoshe, kaha akapua citenga cakupangesa ha cipale, viakulela na seho kuli liavenia njivo, vialivuahesela lumo kuvipangesa ku vipangi viacili. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Teua ku mashungu a vukuenje kaha pangela lika vusunga, na lutsilielo, na cizango, na ciyulo hamo na vaje vasana Muene na mitima yakulela. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Litenge ku vimpata via vulema na vunzimba, uazivuka nguove vikanehe kulicokota. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Ngamba ya Muene kapandele kupua muka kulicokota vuno honi napande kupua ua ngozi ku muntu uoshe, mulongisi uacili, ua mutima uakusimpa, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />uje asa kuhilula vaje vamuluisa na mutima uakulikehesa. Linga hamo Njambi akavahanako ntsimbu ngeci vakatenguluke ku vipi kaha vakazivuke vusunga, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />linga vateue ku muheto ua Liyavolo, uje navakuata ngeci vapange muaya cizango cendi.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Matangua a mamanusuilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Vuno honi ivuisisa eci, mu matangua akumanusuilo kukakala vintsimbu viakukaluua. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Muomu vantu vakapua vaka kulizanga vakevo vavenia, vakazanga vimbongo, vakalihalesa, vaka lijundula, vakapua vaka kasauntu, vakahona kuononoka visemi viavo, vakahona kutsantsela, vaka kuhona kulela, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />vaka keniuka, vakahona cikeketima, vakapua vakaleho va makuli, vakapua vaka cipululu, vakahona kulihilula, vakazinda viacili, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />vaka lu uangania, vaka lupozoka, vaka shula nakulihalesa, vaka zanga senga kupulakana kuzanga Njambi, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />vaka kakateya viuma via vunjambi vuno honi vakaviana nzili yavio. Litengeni ku vantu ava. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Muomu vamo vavo vakalingi vingila viavo viakukovela mu vinjivo via vantu nakukuata vampuevo vaje vakuzeya, vaje vali na viteli via vipi kaha vanashulu na miyati yoshe ya viuma via mazilo, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />vampuevo vaje vakevuilila ku muntu uoshe vuno honi kuvasa kuheta ha ntsimbu ya kuzivuka mana a vusunga. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Ngue Njane na Njambele valuisile Mosesa, mukemo vene na vantu ava valuisa vusunga, vantu va mana a civembulu kaha vaka kuhonoua mu lutsilielo. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Vuno honi kuvasa kuya kulutue, muomu vulema vuavo vukasholoka ku vantu voshe, ngue vua vaje vamala vavali va Njane na Njambele.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vishika via mamanusuilo kuli Timateo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Honi yove Timateo unakavangeya vilongesa viange, nakatumamesi kange, na vutumbe vua vuyoye vuange, na lutsilielo luange, na kusimpa cange, na cizango cange, na lukakateya luange, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />na mapakeso ange, na tuyando tuange, na viuma vije vialingiuile kuli yange ku Antioke, naku Ikoniyame naku Lisitala, mapakeso akukomouesa aje anjatambuile, vuno honi Muene uanjohielele ku vioshe evi. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Cilivene uoshe uje atonda kuyoya vuyoye vua vunjambi muli Kilistu Yesu vaka mupakesa, <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />oku vantu vaka vupi na vaka kukuisa vakatualelelaho kulinga vupi cikuma, kukuisa vakuavo na vakuavo naua vakavakuisa. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Vuno honi yove tualelelaho kuli vije unalilongesa kaha kolesa mukutsiliela muomu uazivuka uje ku ualilongeselevio, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />kuhuma ku vuanike vuove uazivuka vilongesa via kulela vije viasa kukutuamenena ku kuovoka kuhitila mu lutsilielo muli Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Visoneka vioshe Njambi uavihuiminine kaha vili naseho mukulongesa, na mukushulisisa, na mukuhilula, na mukuhana vilongesa mu vusunga, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />linga muntu ua Njambi apue uamutuntu, nakushula mu vipangi vioshe viacili.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Njikushika ha mesho a Njambi na Kilistu Yesu vaje vakasompo vaka kuyoya na vaka kutsa, kaha mukusholoka cendi na vumuene vuendi, <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />ambulula lizi, livuahesele vualumo mu vintsimbu viacili cipue via vipi, sungamesa, tenukila, kolesa, longesa na lukakateya, keti uhonoue mukusimpa namu kulongesa. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Muomu ntsimbu ilinakuija omo vantu kuvakahakela mana ku vilongesa via vusunga vuno honi vaka kavangeya mashungu avo, kaha vaka litondela vakevo vavenia valongisi vavengi vaje vakavaleka vije viatonda matuitui avo kuivua. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Kaha vakalikela kuvuilila ku vusunga nakuputuka kuvuilila visimo via makuli. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Vuno honi yove ntsimbu yoshe livuahesele vualumo, kolesa mu tuyando, linga vipangi viakuambulula Muzimbu Uacili, shulisisa vipangi viove.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Muomu yange njalivuahesela vualumo kunjilinga nkombelo, ntsimbu yange yakukatuka inahete. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Njinalu nzita yacili, njinashatuka nakumanusula seteko yange, njinaniungu lutsilielo luange. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Honi kuli cilongo ca vusunga civananjitulikila, cije Muene ikeye muka kusompa ua vusunga akanjihanaco ha Litangua lije, kaha keti yange lika vuno honi na vaje voshe vazangele kuija cendi.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mezi ange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Linga muoshe muuasela linga uije kuli yange vuavuno. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Muomu Ndemase nazange mavu aua aliko, nanjiseze nakuya ku Tesalonika, na Kelesenese nayi ku Ngalatiya, na Tito nayi ku Ndalematiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Kuvanga lika Luka likaliendi ikeye ali nange kuno. Ija hamo na Mako, ngeci akunjikuaseko vipangi kuno. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Njatumu Taikikase ku Efeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Omo uija, ija na kazaku kaje kanjasezele kuli Kapasi ku Tolouase, na mavulu, kaha cikuma kumani mikanda yange ije yakuzenga ya vilambu.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Elekizanda uje muka kufula nanjilingi muamupi cikuma, Muene akamuhana fueto kuya ku vipangi viendi. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Litenge kuli ikeye, muomu ualuisile muzimbu uetu na nzili.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Ha kuliluila cange cakulivanga, naumo uahi uanjikuasele, voshe vanjisezele. Keti vavahisileco! <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Vuno honi Muene uakele nange nakunjikolesa mukuambulula muzimbu mukushula, linga na vaje voshe keti Vayunda vauvue. Kaha uanjovuele naku kutsa. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Muene akanjovola ku via vipi vioshe nakunjohiela muomu ya vumuene vuendi vua muilu. Kuli ikeye kukale vumpau ku miaka yoshe ya yaye. Ameni.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vihindu via mamanusuilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Hana vihindu kuli Pulisila na Akuila nakuli vaka ntanga ya Onesifolase. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Elasitase uasalele ku Kolinte, kaha njasezele Tolofimase ku Miletase oku avavala. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Linga muoshe muje muuaselamo ngeci uije ntsimbu kanda cisika cihete. Eumbulase nakumeneka hamo na Pundenisi na Linase na Kalaundiya na vaka kutsiliela voshe vanakumeneka. <verse eid="2TI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Muene akale na cimbembesi cove. Kavumbi kakale nove.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>